<title>JAPAN: Japan Feb dept store sales fall 0.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Feb dept store sales fall 0.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales at department stores in Japan in February fell 0.5 percent from a year earlier to 601.99  billion yen, the Japan Department Stores' Association said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The survey covered 263 outlets of 110 companies, the association said in a statement.</p>
